:: ccm-vintage-lettered {"position": "1400,500", "size": "100,100"}
In general, CCM Vintage jerseys in lettered sizes are not faked.

However, you can ask in the <a href="https://reddit.com/r/hockeyjerseys/about/sticky">r/hockeyjerseys monthly legit check thread</a> or the <a href="https://discord.com/invite/hockeyjerseys">Hockey Jerseys Discord</a> if you're not sure.

